<title>USA: PaineWebber names managing director.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber names managing director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Group Inc said on Thursday that it has named Charles Paviolitis managing director in its Municipal Securities Group, to oversee risk management and institutional trading.</p>
<p>Paviolitis was previously director of the municipal securities group for EVEREN Securities Inc, a subsidiary of EVEREN Capital Corp.</p>
<p>He reports to William Jester, managing director and manager of the Municipal Securities Group's municipal bond department.  </p>
<p>Information on whom Paviolitis replaces was not immediatley available.</p>
</text>
